**/*.log
# The demo directory is excluded wholesale, then the four pieces the `demo` image
# stage needs are re-included by name. Keeping the exclusion broad matters: demo/
# accumulates build output — DB, Lucene, Taxonomy, run, node_modules, screenshots —
# none of which belongs in an image, and all of which would otherwise arrive
# silently the moment someone runs the local demo before building.
demo/
!demo/deploy/
!demo/app-static/
!demo/test/data/
!demo/test/tests.json
# app-static/tests.json is a symlink to ../test/tests.json that `task app` creates for
# the local workflow. Copied into the image it stays a symlink, Jetty refuses to serve
# a link that leaves its base directory, and the app's examples list 404s. Excluded
# here so the Dockerfile can put the real file in its place.
demo/app-static/tests.json
docs/
